cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SkillStack in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "SkillStack"
abstract: >-
  SkillStack is a composable library of 168 skills, organized into 9
  independent theme folders, that an LLM agent loads on demand to execute
  research, ML, data, writing, and AI-safety tasks. A maestro orchestrator at
  the root classifies any incoming task and routes it to the correct theme and
  skill. Themes are non-numbered so any can be dropped, swapped, or renamed
  without renumbering the others. MIT-licensed.
